      "page": 432,
      "ruku": 373,
      "hizbQuarter": 173,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3643,
      "text": "It is not your wealth or your children that bring you closer to Us; but those who believe and do righteous deeds, it is they who will have a multiple reward for what they did, and they will be safe in the lofty mansions.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 34,
        "name": "سُورَةُ سَبَإٍ",
        "englishName": "Saba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Sheba",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 432,
      "ruku": 374,
      "hizbQuarter": 173,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3644,
      "text": "But those who strive against Our verses[21], seeking to discredit them, it is they who will be summoned to the punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 34,
        "name": "سُورَةُ سَبَإٍ",
        "englishName": "Saba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Sheba",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
